config BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_NOMADNET
	bool "python-nomadnet"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_RNS         # runtime
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_LXMF        # runtime
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_URWID       # runtime (TUI)
	select BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_QRCODE      # runtime (QR identity codes)
	help
	  Nomad Network — a Reticulum-based application stack that
	  ships an LXMF propagation node, a nomadnet "page" server
	  (gopher-like browsable content over Reticulum), and a
	  terminal UI client. Installed here primarily so users can
	  host nomadnet pages from the device; the init script
	  S83nomadnet is shipped disabled by default and gated on a
	  flag in /etc/rnsbox/nomadnet.conf.

	  https://github.com/markqvist/NomadNet
